# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and on checkout, on
# every platform -- avoids the classic Windows-git-vs-WSL-git false-diff
# (every line showing as changed) when the same working tree is touched by
# two git clients with different core.autocrlf defaults. Found while
# verifying S0's reproducibility across both Windows and WSL environments.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Jupyter notebooks are JSON; treat as text but let git diff them as JSON
# rather than binary (still LF-normalized per the rule above).
*.ipynb text
